    {
        "content": "<p>macovedj opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14518\">PR #14518</a> from <code>macovedj:p2-tcp-close-unread-rst</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Closing a P2 TCP socket with unread received data currently shuts down its retained streams before closing the native descriptor. The peer can therefore observe a clean EOF instead of the connection reset expected when closing a socket with unread data.</p>\n<p>This PR resets connected sockets with unread data before their retained streams drop, using zero linger plus <code>connect(AF_UNSPEC)</code> on Linux/Android and <code>disconnectx</code> on Apple targets.</p>\n</blockquote>",
